  "description": "Attribute-based Kafka service framework for .NET — write Kafka consumers like ASP.NET controllers. Routing by message header, JSON/Avro/Protobuf, at-least-once delivery with retries and a dead-letter queue, auto-scaling consumers, and full passthrough to the underlying Confluent.Kafka (SSL/SASL) configuration.",
