  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0 — First public release. Attribute-based services, header routing, JSON/Avro/Protobuf handlers, ErrorPolicy (Skip/Dlq/Stop) with clamped exponential retry, ConsumerMode.Single/Auto (auto-scaling consumers per topic), first-class SSL/SASL options plus raw librdkafka passthrough, OpenTelemetry ActivitySource + metrics. Fully tested.",
